From 768fdaca94d914a0af5c4f1b9660d2cc289baf72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 11:44:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] QUIET v32: figure defaults at R 95 % (the M2 minimum),
 milestone check

Fig. 2 case menu defaults to 3.3 um R 95 %; Fig. 3 solid curves R 95 %,
dash-dot R 99.5 %, dashed R 97 % optional. scripts/t14_milestones.py checks
M3, M4, M7 against R. REPORT 6i item 13.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NLfEqncaEw1RGMDLUGdFgb
---
 QUIET_sims_v32/REPORT.md                      |  1 +
 QUIET_sims_v32/artifacts/fig2_v32.html        |  8 +++---
 QUIET_sims_v32/artifacts/fig3_v32.html        |  2 +-
 QUIET_sims_v32/results/t14/milestones.txt     |  9 +++++++
 QUIET_sims_v32/scripts/build_t14_artifacts.py | 24 ++++++++---------
 QUIET_sims_v32/scripts/t14_milestones.py      | 27 +++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 54 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 QUIET_sims_v32/results/t14/milestones.txt
